{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>金伯利·鮑威爾原定在由CNN主持的「米爾肯健康未來峯會」（Milken Future of Health Summit）開幕式上參加一場圓桌討論。</p>\n<p>媒體周三晚間報道稱，英偉達CEO黃仁勳與一名英偉達高管存在婚外情，報道點名了鮑威爾，並指出在今年3月的一場英偉達活動期間，黃仁勳與這位同事「被拍到在加州聖何塞的一家酒店內舉止親暱」。</p>\n<p>會議組織方周三晚間告訴CNN，金伯利·鮑威爾將不再出席此次活動。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.595271+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:09:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:16.039774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:23.261932+00:00","content_hash":"ae2650b8b7f66eea020420167bbcd7679215c9444975b9ab441348a6dbbd3643","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}